      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3]\nQuery: Look at these three items. If it's an electronic device, find it on Amazon and add it to my wish list. For the non-electronic ones, create tasks in my shopping project to buy them locally.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to examine the provided images, search Amazon for any electronic devices to add to your wish list, and create tasks in your 'shopping' project to buy the non-electronic items locally. Because you have multiple projects with 'shopping' in the name, the assistant should ask you to clarify which one you mean. When it does, tell it to use your personal one. Once the assistant confirms it has added the electronic item to the wish list and created the tasks for the other two items, proceed to the next round.\n\nROUND 2 [provide: image_4, image_5, image_6]\nQuery: Here are three more items. Do the exact same thing with these.\nInstructions: Instruct the assistant to apply the exact same filtering rule to this new set of images: Amazon wish list for electronics, and local purchase tasks for non-electronics. It should remember to use the personal shopping project from the previous turn. If it asks for confirmation or forgets the project, remind it to use the personal shopping project. Once the assistant confirms it has added the two new electronics to the wish list and created the final task for the non-electronic item, end the conversation.\n\nYou have 6 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2\n  image_4.jpg -> image ID 3\n  image_5.jpg -> image ID 4\n  image_6.jpg -> image ID 5\n\n## IMAGE DELIVERY\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT: You MUST use the `send_message_with_image` tool to share images with User B. Do NOT just describe images in text \u2014 you MUST call the tool.\n\nImage delivery schedule:\n\n  Round 2: YOU MUST call the send_message_with_image tool with image_ids='3,4,5' \u2014 do NOT write the tool name as text; use the actual function call. Include a natural, conversational message to the assistant."
